WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:01,430
Sister Chen Yao

2
00:00:01,690 --> 00:00:03,450
It's just right to be in the same group as you

3
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:07,600
Some words have changed for a long time. What happened? My hand stopped.

4
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,720
I think we have to leave Su Weiwei as soon as possible

5
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:11,960
Go to Lin Feng

6
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:17,140
Su Weiwei used the lighter in her hand as a blessing

7
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:18,620
But Lin Feng started from the first day

8
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:19,660
There is no shortage of fire

9
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:22,720
Our only advantage is that we have more people

10
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:25,060
But a dozen mouths

11
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:27,500
The food consumed every day is terrible

12
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:30,030
Lin Feng went out alone for a day

13
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:31,710
Can get four pheasants

14
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:32,950
add a lot of fruit

15
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:35,380
In terms of survivability

16
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:37,500
He forced us too much

17
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:39,260
The further back in time you go

18
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:40,780
Either we are hungry

19
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:42,420
Either wag your tail to Lin Feng and start the battle

20
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:43,820
no matter what the price

21
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:45,620
We all have to find a way

22
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:49,500
Join Lin Feng's side as soon as possible. Join early and get a foothold early.

23
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:51,860
I really wait for Su Weiwei’s papery alliance

24
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:52,980
completely collapsed

25
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:55,260
A large group of people ran to beg Lin Feng to take him in

26
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,140
When the time comes, we will try to get together

27
00:00:57,460 --> 00:00:59,060
Destined to be added first

28
00:00:59,380 --> 00:01:00,300
trampled underfoot
